{"title":"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Abe holds 1 green and 1 red jelly bean in his hand. Bob holds 1 green, 1 yellow, and 2 red jelly beans in his hand. Each randomly picks a jelly bean to show the other. What is the probability that the colors match?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f887664ce49aae0570183b7a4f419c915e6f446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac14 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac13 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac38 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac12 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"367\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The favorable responses are either they both show a green bean or they both show a red bean. The probability that both show a green bean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa8f17838041e573fa6e6ac4147c2c4301dc57c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" />. The probability that both show a red bean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d5394a7d7172757069038617c7c547793e7c19c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" />. Therefore the probability is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e67a4e363fddbfc60597ffb02e4d4c04600567e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{8}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"131\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can list out all the combinations and we get this: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c2269951419703052cd1682700df4d5f3b07780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GG, GY, GR_1, GR_2, RG, RY, RR_1, RR_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"308\" height=\"18\" />. There is a total of 8 combinations and 3 that are the same. Hence, we yield the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b9b68aaa5462a2128fb5d06e10449ebc58b641f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NMpVIy8QxSY\">https://youtu.be/NMpVIy8QxSY</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 8\">2013 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2013\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AM